  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let X and Y be closed, oriented, smooth 4-manifolds with the same Euler characteristic and signature. Is there a torus link L in X with trivial normal bundle such that some choice of torus surgery along L transforms X into a manifold diffeomorphic to Y? What if we only require that the result be homeomorphic to Y?",
